        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin TAD, Arch Rose Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Arched Rose Deadbolt is a great way to add a classic touch to any home. It is available in either a single cylinder with a key on one side and a thumb turn on the other or a double cylinder which is operated by a key from both sides. The Arch Deadbolt comes in in array of finishes. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Arch Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin 5 pin C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>2-1/8\" cross bore and 1\" edge bore for latch.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Tested to exceed ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Traditional Arched Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection, Single Cylinder: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection, Double Cylinder: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Standard: 1-3/4\" - 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Optional:  1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" or 2\" - 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> Deadbolt is operated by a thumbturn on the interior and a key from the exterior</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Deadbolt is operated by a key from both the interior and the exterior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Traditional-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"523\" height=\"71\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Reserve Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
