                "title": "Traditional Arched Rose Deadbolt, Baldwin TAD",
                "description": "Baldwin TAD, Traditional Arched Rose Deadbolt - The Traditional Arched Rose Deadbolt is a great way to add a classic touch to any home. It is available in either a single cylinder with a key on one side and a thumb turn on the other or a double cylinder which is operated by a key from both sides. The Arch Deadbolt comes in 7 finishes. It will fit doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets.",
